    "Title": "Symptoms and signs of heart failure (typical / less typical and more / less specific)",
    "Typical Symptoms": [
      "Breathlessness",
      "Orthopnoea",
      "Paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea",
      "Reduced exercise tolerance",
      "Fatigue, tiredness, increased time to recover after exercise",
      "Ankle swelling"
